dent:** The create-incident call timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying, and INC-0001 already exists as a SEV2 for checkout-api. It describes the rollback, the partial failure, and the follow-up, so I did not open a duplicate.\n\nFollow-up: someone should investigate why v2.3.1 failed and look into the orchestrator partial failure before re-releasing.", "type": "text"}]}]}